This method uses XOR to find the number that appears only once:

Duplicate numbers cancel out (a ^ a = 0)
Remaining value is the unique number


⏱️ Complexities

Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
class Solution {
    public int singleNumber(int[] nums) {
        int xor=0;
        for(int num: nums){
            xor^=num;
        }
        return xor;
        
    }
}
